{
 "name": "interaction-disabled-asks",
 "about": "agent.interactionProfile=disabled（interaction/InteractionProfile.ts，ProfiledPermissionDecisionPort.ts，InteractionPolicy.ts，deterministicElicitationAnswerer.ts，SessionInteractionBundle.ts:117-262）：缺省权限模式下要询问的 write_file / bash、ask_user_question（多选与单选）、计划模式的 exit_plan_mode 批准，是否发询问、结果是什么。采集器对任何询问都会应答（权限允许、提问取消），所以多发询问会体现为差异而不是超时。最后一轮客户端在 submit_turn 上带 canPrompt:true 试图重新打开询问。",
 "config": "schemaVersion: 1\nagent:\n  model: bbx/deterministic\n  maxContextTokens: 65536\n  maxOutputTokens: 8192\n  interactionProfile: disabled\nmodel:\n  providers:\n    bbx:\n      protocol: openai\n      url: {MOCK}/v1\n      apiKey: bbx-mock-only\n      models:\n        deterministic:\n          capabilities:\n            supportsToolUse: true\n            maxContextTokens: 65536\n            maxOutputTokens: 8192\ntelemetry:\n  enabled: false\n",
